2. Attach task profile: attach_task_profile ?candidate ?route_task_profile. Precondition: candidate_created ?candidate, vehicle_allocated ?candidate, route_task_profile_available ?route_task_profile. Effect: candidate_task_profile_linked, not route_task_profile_available.

