Thus we need operator_available driver_operator_alpha (true). So assign operator.

7. Need to load cargo onto origin: action load_origin_payload with parameters (?origin_availability - origin_candidate_availability ?origin_node - origin_node ?payload_unit - cargo_payload). Precondition: candidate_prepared ?origin_availability, origin_availability_node_linked ?origin_availability ?origin_node, cargo_available ?payload_unit, not origin_availability_locked ?origin_availability. Effect: origin_node_occupied, origin_availability_locked, origin_payload_linked, not cargo_available.

Thus after we have candidate_prepared, node linked, cargo available, and not locked, we can load. This will lock origin availability and occupy node.

